# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Cara mengetatkan sempadan dengan had kelajuan untuk versi terkini Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit"
msgstr "Cara mengetatkan sempadan dengan had kelajuan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/speed-limit-tightening.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Information in a circuit of two-qubit gates cannot spread arbitrarily fast. An error occurring\n"
"several layers before the end, on a qubit far from the observable's support, has no path to reach\n"
"it. `tighten_with_speed_limit` turns that geometric argument (the same intuition behind the\n"
"Lieb-Robinson bounds) into tighter forward bounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maklumat dalam litar gate dua-qubit tidak boleh merebak dengan kelajuan sewenang-wenangnya. Ralat yang berlaku\n"
"beberapa lapisan sebelum akhir, pada qubit yang jauh daripada sokongan observable, tidak mempunyai laluan untuk sampai\n"
"kepadanya. `tighten_with_speed_limit` menukarkan hujah geometri itu (intuisi yang sama di sebalik\n"
"sempadan Lieb-Robinson) kepada sempadan hadapan yang lebih ketat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The step is cheap, needs nothing beyond what the forward bounds already required, and can only make\n"
"bounds tighter. There is no accuracy trade-off to weigh.\n"
msgstr ""
"Langkah ini murah, tidak memerlukan apa-apa selain yang sedia diperlukan oleh sempadan hadapan, dan hanya boleh menjadikan\n"
"sempadan lebih ketat. Tiada pertukaran ketepatan yang perlu ditimbang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The question worth answering first is *\"when does it help?\"*, because it doesn't often help on a fully converged set of forward\n"
"bounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"Soalan yang patut dijawab dahulu ialah *\"bilakah ia membantu?\"*, kerana ia jarang membantu pada set sempadan hadapan yang\n"
"telah menumpu sepenuhnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Persediaan {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the same Trotterized Ising circuit as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), with the observable\n"
"on a single qubit in the middle of the chain. The 1D geometry makes the effect easy to reason about: an influence has\n"
"to traverse the chain one bond per layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan litar Ising yang di-Trotter yang sama seperti [panduan permulaan pantas](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), dengan observable\n"
"pada satu qubit di tengah rantai. Geometri 1D memudahkan penaakulan tentang kesannya: sesuatu pengaruh\n"
"perlu merentasi rantai satu ikatan bagi setiap lapisan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When it helps, and when it does not {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"
msgstr "Bilakah ia membantu, dan bilakah tidak {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`tighten_with_speed_limit` takes the bounds you already have and returns a tightened copy; your\n"
"original bounds are never modified. How much it gains depends entirely on how loose the input was.\n"
msgstr ""
"`tighten_with_speed_limit` mengambil sempadan yang sedia ada pada anda dan mengembalikan salinan yang diketatkan; sempadan\n"
"asal anda tidak pernah diubah suai. Sejauh mana ia mendapat manfaat bergantung sepenuhnya pada betapa longgarnya input.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first line is the one to notice. On fully computed forward bounds, the speed limit changes\n"
"nothing. That is not a failure. It means the bounds were already at least as tight as the geometric\n"
"argument can prove, because the operator evolution has effectively discovered the light cone for\n"
"itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baris pertama ialah yang perlu diberi perhatian. Pada sempadan hadapan yang dikira sepenuhnya, had kelajuan tidak mengubah\n"
"apa-apa. Itu bukan kegagalan. Ia bermaksud sempadan sudah sekurang-kurangnya seketat yang dapat dibuktikan oleh hujah\n"
"geometri, kerana evolusi operator telah menemui kon cahaya\n"
"sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gains appear where the bounds were *not* fully computed:\n"
msgstr "Peningkatan muncul di tempat sempadan *tidak* dikira sepenuhnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`eigval_max_qubits=0` forces the triangle-inequality fallback, so the bounds no longer reflect the\n"
"commutator's actual spectral norm. The speed limit recovers part of that loss.\n"
msgstr ""
"`eigval_max_qubits=0` memaksa penggunaan fallback ketaksamaan segi tiga, jadi sempadan tidak lagi mencerminkan\n"
"norma spektrum sebenar komutator. Had kelajuan memulihkan sebahagian daripada kehilangan itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`max_num_boxes=2` leaves most layers at the trivial bound of 2.0 (a bound that encodes no\n"
"information). Here, the speed limit is helpful, cutting the mean by roughly\n"
"a factor of three.\n"
msgstr ""
"`max_num_boxes=2` membiarkan kebanyakan lapisan pada sempadan remeh 2.0 (sempadan yang tidak mengekodkan\n"
"sebarang maklumat). Di sini, had kelajuan membantu, mengurangkan min kira-kira\n"
"sebanyak tiga kali ganda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In every case the \"loosened\" column is zero. No term is ever made worse, which is the guarantee that\n"
"makes the step safe to apply unconditionally.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam setiap kes, lajur \"dilonggarkan\" ialah sifar. Tiada terma yang pernah dijadikan lebih teruk, iaitu jaminan yang\n"
"menjadikan langkah ini selamat untuk digunakan tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What it buys in sampling overhead {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"
msgstr "Apa yang diperoleh dalam overhed pensampelan {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tighter bounds mean there are fewer error terms that need mitigating for a given bias tolerance, which is the\n"
"number that matters on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sempadan yang lebih ketat bermakna lebih sedikit terma ralat yang perlu dimitigasi bagi sesuatu toleransi bias, iaitu\n"
"nombor yang penting pada perkakasan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use it {#when-to-use-it}"
msgstr "Bila hendak menggunakannya {#when-to-use-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply it to forward bounds whenever those bounds are not fully converged (essentially,\n"
"whenever you have traded accuracy for speed by using any of the options in the\n"
"[configuration guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). It is cheap compared to the bounds computation,\n"
"cannot make anything worse, and recovers much of what a `max_num_boxes` or `eigval_max_qubits` limit\n"
"gave away.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakannya pada sempadan hadapan setiap kali sempadan itu belum menumpu sepenuhnya (pada dasarnya,\n"
"setiap kali anda telah menukar ketepatan dengan kelajuan dengan menggunakan mana-mana pilihan dalam\n"
"[panduan konfigurasi](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). Ia murah berbanding pengiraan sempadan,\n"
"tidak boleh menjadikan apa-apa lebih teruk, dan memulihkan banyak perkara yang dilepaskan oleh had `max_num_boxes` atau `eigval_max_qubits`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On fully computed bounds it is a no-op, so there is no harm in applying it unconditionally.\n"
msgstr "Pada sempadan yang dikira sepenuhnya ia tidak melakukan apa-apa, jadi tiada salahnya menggunakannya tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two limitations:\n"
msgstr "Dua batasan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It applies to **forward** bounds only. Backward bounds concern the error's effect on the initial\n"
"state rather than on the observable, so the argument does not carry over.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ia hanya terpakai pada sempadan **hadapan**. Sempadan belakang berkaitan kesan ralat terhadap keadaan\n"
"awal dan bukan terhadap observable, jadi hujah itu tidak berlanjutan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The observable must be a **single Pauli term**. For an observable with several terms, call this\n"
"once per Pauli and combine the results yourself. If the observable is not a single Pauli term, it raises a `NotImplementedError`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Observable mestilah **satu terma Pauli**. Untuk observable dengan beberapa terma, panggil ini\n"
"sekali bagi setiap Pauli dan gabungkan hasilnya sendiri. Jika observable bukan satu terma Pauli, ia menimbulkan `NotImplementedError`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the standard workflow, it belongs between computing the forward bounds and merging them with the\n"
"backward bounds, as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart) shows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam aliran kerja standard, ia terletak antara pengiraan sempadan hadapan dan penggabungannya dengan\n"
"sempadan belakang, seperti yang ditunjukkan oleh [panduan permulaan pantas](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"
